      "writtenOn": "2022-06-23T05:53:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Use \u003e at here is because of some remote devices will have interoperation issue when receive AVRCP version 1.5(default version right now). \nIf those devices are in IOP database and our version high than 1.4, we reply version 1.4 to them to avoid IOP issue. \nIf current avrcp_version is lower/equal to 1.4, we can just reply current avrcp_version.\n\navrcp_version return by sdpu_is_avrcp_profile_description_list will be vesions(0x01000, 0x0103, 0x0104, 0x0105, 0x0106) or 0 for value not valid. \nAt following Dynamic ACRCP version part, if Dynamic ACRCP version is disabled or avrcp_version is 0, Dynamic ACRCP version will be skiped",
      "parentUuid": "14492768_80e7850b",
